5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"Since we're settling this, we need a clear picture of how the car is actually being used. I think we should start by looking at the facts.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,"I couldn't agree more, Misaki! Let's keep it breezy but thorough. I'm curious about the actual time spent on this, so I'll start there.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is wise to seek clarity. To understand the true balance of our sharing, I believe we should examine last year's tax, insurance and parking papers, as well as the hours of use recorded in the diary.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I want to know why things are getting tense between us. I'll look into what two other car-sharing households said and the spell of checking each other's figures to see where others messed up.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to know exactly how much we're spending! I'll check last year's fuel receipts and the month's trial of recording every run to see who's driving the most.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I agree with the others. To get a better sense of the daily reality, I'll look into the trips that repeat weekly and the state of the car at handover.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"Since everyone is picking their favorites, I'll jump in! I want to see the hours of use recorded in the diary and the spell of checking each other's figures. Let's see where the time really goes!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,I am content with my choices. Let us allow the facts to guide us toward a fair and harmonious resolution for everyone.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, facts are fine, but they don't tell us why we're arguing. I'm sticking with my choices. I want to make sure we don't just fix the money and keep fighting.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, I get that, but knowing the money part helps stop the fighting! I'm excited to see what the receipts actually show. Let's just get all the info first!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,It seems we have a good variety of data points covered. I'm interested to see if the handover state reveals why the car isn't always ready when needed. Let's proceed with these selections.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,I'm all set! I've got my eyes on the diary and those figure-checks. I have a feeling we'll find some very interesting patterns in how we spend our time. Let's get to it!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, and so is preparation. I believe we have cast a wide enough net to capture the truth. I look forward to seeing how these pieces fit together for our collective good.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm ready. Just don't expect me to just nod along if the ""facts"" ignore the way we're treating each other. Let's see what we find.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm ready too! I think we've covered everything from the money to the feelings. I can't wait to see the real numbers and figure this out together!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"Since we've all made our choices, let's move forward. I hope the information we gather helps us create a system that actually works for everyone's daily routine.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,I'm totally ready for the reveal! Let's see if the numbers are as dramatic as our arguments. I'll be waiting with bated breath to see what we've actually been doing with our time!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Servas,,"May, your enthusiasm is a gift. Let us now step forward with open minds and gentle hearts, ready to accept whatever the records reveal so that we may find a path of true equity.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Whatever. Just make sure we actually talk about the tension and not just the paperwork. I'm done for this round.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
